### ===================================================
### Banking Transactions API - Sample Requests
### ===================================================
### Use with VS Code REST Client extension or similar.

### --- Health Check ---
GET http://localhost:3000/

### --- Task 1: Core API ---

### Create a deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 1000.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create another deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 500.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Create a transfer
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "toAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 250.50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Create a withdrawal
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "ACC-67890",
  "amount": 100.00,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "withdrawal"
}

### Create a EUR deposit
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 200.00,
  "currency": "EUR",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Get all transactions
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions

### Get transaction by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_ACTUAL_ID

### Get account balance
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### --- Task 2: Validation ---

### Invalid amount (negative)
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": -50,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### Invalid account format
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fromAccount": "INVALID",
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "USD",
  "type": "transfer"
}

### Invalid currency
POST http://localhost:3000/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "toAccount": "ACC-12345",
  "amount": 100,
  "currency": "FAKE",
  "type": "deposit"
}

### --- Task 3: Filtering ---

### Filter by account
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345

### Filter by type
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?type=transfer

### Filter by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### Combined filters
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=deposit

### --- Task 4A: Account Summary ---
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/summary

### --- Task 4B: Interest Calculation ---
GET http://localhost:3000/accounts/ACC-12345/interest?rate=0.05&days=30

### --- Task 4C: CSV Export ---
GET http://localhost:3000/transactions/export?format=csv

### --- 404 Test ---
GET http://localhost:3000/nonexistent
